'''Joe Frank Burns''' (born September 15, 1979) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets football|Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets]].
